his ad! <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Ooh! Mexico! It looks so nice!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I need a change ... I love to travel.", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn3le04ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Me, too! I want to go on a vacation too.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I would love to visit the beaches and go surfing ... and sightsee.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I prefer to travel in the mountains and to go hiking. Sometimes I like to go fishing.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I love to travel to deserts. <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Deserts? You're crazy!", "id": 2, "time": "20500", "image": "engenn3le04ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I'd like to practice my Spanish in Mexico.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Good idea! Let's practice together before you go.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good thinking. Well, I have to go and call this travel agent. Ciao! <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Hasta la vista, baby.", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn3le04ob01re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le04ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le04ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}